  "body": "Looking for something solid, sunny and surprisingly spacious? This elevated brick and tile home offers more than you might expect, with freehold ownership, a lovely outlook and plenty of room to enjoy both inside and out.\r\n\r\nWhether you're buying your first home, looking to downsize or searching for a smart investment, 144B Glamorgan Drive is well worth a closer look.\r\n\r\nStep inside to discover light-filled living that flows effortlessly to the balcony, the perfect spot to relax, entertain or simply enjoy the elevated outlook.\r\n\r\nBoth bedrooms are generously proportioned, while full insulation, a heat pump and HRV system help keep things comfortable throughout the seasons.\r\n\r\nOutside, the 390m2 freehold section offers room to garden, relax or create your own outdoor haven. Add in the spacious high-stud lock-up garage and excellent additional parking, and there's plenty of practicality to match the appeal.\r\n\r\nProperty highlights:\r\n* Solid brick and tile construction\r\n* Freehold 390m2 section\r\n* Elevated position with a lovely outlook\r\n* Sunny living with great balcony flow\r\n* Fully insulated, heat pump and HRV\r\n* Spacious high-stud garage plus off-street parking\r\n* Zoned for Glamorgan Primary, Northcross Intermediate and Long Bay College\r\n\r\nConveniently located close to schools, beaches, shops and transport, this is a home that makes everyday living easy.\r\n\r\nrwmairangibay.co.nz/MRG35683",
